### GET /planetas/importarSWAPI (index)
GET http://localhost:8000/planetas/importarSWAPI HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### GET /planetas (index)
GET http://localhost:8000/planetas HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### GET /planetas/4 (show)
GET http://localhost:8000/planetas/4 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### POST /planetas (store)
POST http://localhost:8000/planetas HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "MiTierra",
  "horasDia": 24,
  "diasAnyo": 365,
  "clima": "templado, mediterraneo",
  "terreno": "llanuras, rios, mares, acantilados"

}


### PUT /planetas/4 (update)
PUT http://localhost:8000/planetas/4 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Bespin",
  "horasDia": 15,
  "diasAnyo": 5110,
  "clima": "templado",
  "terreno": "variado, gasoso, nubes, acantilados"
}


### DELETE /planetas/4 (destroy)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/planetas/4 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
